# Environment variables — copy to .env.local and fill in real values.
# See docs/shopify-setup-checklist.md for the full setup walkthrough
# (Partner account -> development store -> custom app -> Storefront API token).

# ── Shopify Storefront API (Direct Channel /shop) ────────────────────────────
# Both vars must be set together for the shop to be "configured".
# While unset, the site builds and runs gracefully: the catalog is empty,
# /shop renders its "coming soon" state, and nothing crashes.
# Checklist step: create a custom app on the store with the Storefront API
# scope, then copy the token from that app (docs/shopify-setup-checklist.md).

# Your store's myshopify domain, e.g. ntv-dev.myshopify.com
# (no https:// prefix needed — it is normalized if present)
# SHOPIFY_STORE_DOMAIN=ntv-dev.myshopify.com

# Storefront API access token from the store's custom app (starts with shpat_…)
# SHOPIFY_STOREFRONT_ACCESS_TOKEN=
